{
 "title": "Partition",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Partition",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c326",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Britain, exhausted, hands the problem to the new United Nations.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c327",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "On November 29, 1947, the UN votes to divide Palestine",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c328",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "into a Jewish state and an Arab state",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c329",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "with Jerusalem under international control.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c330",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "33 countries vote yes, 13 no, 10 abstain.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c331",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Jewish leadership accepts with reservations.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c332",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Arab leaders reject it.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c333",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They argue that it gives the Jewish minority",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c334",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "about a third of the people more than half the land",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c335",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and that nobody asks the people who lived there.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c336",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Civil war begins the next day.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c337",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In the months that follow, atrocities happen on both sides.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c338",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In April, at the village of Deir Yassin,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c339",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Jewish irregulars kill over 100 Arab villagers.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c340",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Days later, Arab fighters ambush a convoy",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c341",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "heading to Hadassah Hospital",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c342",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and kill 78 Jewish doctors, nurses and others.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c343",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Fear drives people out of their homes on both sides.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c344",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "On May 14, 1948, David Ben Gurion",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c345",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "stands in a Tel Aviv Museum",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c346",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and reads the Declaration of the State of Israel.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c347",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Within minutes, the United States recognizes it.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c348",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The next day, the armies of Egypt, Jordan, Syria, Iraq",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c349",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and Lebanon invade.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c350",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israelis call what follows the war of independence.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c351",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Palestinians call what happens to them the Nakba,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c352",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the catastrophe.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c353",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Both names describe real things.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c354",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israel survives the invasion",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c355",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and ends up with more land than the UN plan gave it.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c356",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "When the fighting stops in 1949, about 700,000 Palestinians,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c357",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "most of the Arabs who lived in what became Israel",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c358",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "have fled or been driven from their homes.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c359",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Historians still argue about how many ran from the fighting",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c360",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and how many were expelled, but they agree on the outcome.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c361",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israel does not let them return.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c362",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They and their descendants, millions of people today",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c363",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "are still counted as refugees.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c364",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Jordan takes the West Bank,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c365",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "including East Jerusalem and the Old City",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c366",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and Jews are expelled from the Old City",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c367",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and kept from the Western Wall for 19 years.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c368",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Egypt takes Gaza.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c369",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Inside Israel, about 150,000 Palestinians stay",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c370",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and become Israeli citizens,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c371",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "though they live under military rule until 1966.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c372",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1950, Israel passes the law of return,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c373",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "which gives any Jew in the world the right",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c374",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "to immigrate and become a citizen.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c375",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Palestinian refugees have no such right.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c376",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "At the same time, another exodus is underway.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c377",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Over the next few decades, around 850,000 Jews leave",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c378",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "or are pushed out of Arab countries and Iran.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c379",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Iraq, Yemen, Morocco, Egypt, Libya.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c380",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Their property is often seized.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c381",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "About 600,000 settle in Israel,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c382",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a country that had 700,000 people",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c383",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and that now doubles in size in just a few years,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c384",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "housing newcomers in tent camps.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c385",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Today, roughly half of Israel's Jews",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c386",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "trace their roots to the Middle East and North Africa,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c387",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "so the war ends with two refugee peoples,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c388",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "two founding stories and no peace.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c389",
     "shot": "g_partition",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Not one Arab state recognizes Israel.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}